    "label": null,
    "prompt": "Suppose that $x$ satisfies both $4x-1<3$ and $2x-3>1$. Attempt to solve for $x$.",
    "layout": "list",
    "columns": null,
    "questionDiagrams": [],
    "children": [],
    "answer": {
      "short": "No solution exists: $x<1$ and $x>2$ cannot both hold.",
      "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}4x-1&<3\\\\4x&<4\\\\x&<1\\end{align*}$$\n\n$$\\begin{align*}2x-3&>1\\\\2x&>4\\\\x&>2\\end{align*}$$\n\nNo value of $x$ satisfies both $x<1$ and $x>2$, so no solution exists.",
